  texture_mask: {fileID: 0}
  title: Bear Load
  text: "When in the American wilderness, it is advised for campers and hikers to
    be on the lookout for bears, to learn bear safety techniques, and to carry bear
    spray at all times, in order to dissuade any would-be killer bears. But what
    if you were a cowboy riding through the open prarie and happened to be charged
    upon by a vicious, hungry grizzly bear? \n\nFortunately for you, American ammunition
    manufacturers have considered this exact seemingly recurring problem before,
    and they've come up with the second best bear repellent there is: the .45 Long
    Colt Bear Load. Not only is the bullet twice as fast, it's also twice as heavy
    as the standard .45 Long Colt \"Cowboy Load\", making it approximately 4 to 5
    times more effective at taking down game; enabling you to take down a single
    grizzly bear, or four to five cowboys if they stand in a line."
  end_padding_seconds: 0
